Origin: EmberBSD (AI-assisted). Upstream status: not submitted.

EmberBSD keeps one FFmpeg recipe (ffmpeg9). Apply after
pkgsrc-kept-version-consumers.patch. Upgrade VLC to 3.0.24 (latest
stable) and enable the Qt6 GUI that matches Plasma. Cross builds use
host luac/protoc/NATIVE_CC and host Qt6 qmake6/moc/rcc/uic with a
qt.conf that points Prefix at the cross sysroot. Disable fluidsynth
(SDL3 outside the default closure) and seed plugins.dat when
vlc-cache-gen cannot run on the build host. PLIST drops youtube.lua,
librist and schroedinger (not in the default closure) and records the
share/applications open-* desktop files from 3.0.24.

